---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Stepan Sazonov
description: Computational physicist and R&D engineer. Nonlinear dynamics, simulation software, and free tools for people who make images.
lang: en
section: home
permalink: /
translationUrl: /ru/
englishUrl: /
---
<section class="home-intro">
  <div class="hero-mark{% if branding.logo %} has-logo{% endif %}" aria-hidden="true">{% if branding.logo %}{{ branding.logo | safe }}{% else %}S{% endif %}</div>
  <h1>Stepan Sazonov</h1>
  <p class="lede">Computational physicist and R&amp;D engineer. Nonlinear dynamics, simulation software, and free tools for people who make images.</p>
</section>

<section class="index-section" aria-labelledby="posts-title">
  <h2 class="section-label" id="posts-title">Posts</h2>
  {% set recentPosts = collections.posts | whereLang("en") | limit(3) %}
  {% if recentPosts.length %}
    <ul class="index-list">
      {% for post in recentPosts %}
        <li><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a><time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | isoDate }}</time></li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    <a class="all-link" href="/posts/">All posts →</a>
  {% else %}
    <p class="empty">Notes on physics, software, and production are in progress.</p>
  {% endif %}
</section>

<section class="index-section" aria-labelledby="projects-title">
  <h2 class="section-label" id="projects-title">Projects</h2>
  <ul class="index-list">
    {% for project in collections.projects | whereLang("en") | limit(3) %}
      <li><a href="{{ project.url }}">{{ project.data.title }}</a><time>{{ project.data.year }}</time></li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
  <a class="all-link" href="/projects/">All projects →</a>
</section>

<section class="index-section" aria-labelledby="tools-title">
  <h2 class="section-label" id="tools-title">Tools</h2>
  <ul class="index-list">
    {% for tool in tools %}
      <li>
        {% if tool.url %}<a href="{{ tool.url }}">{{ tool.name }}</a>{% else %}<strong>{{ tool.name }}</strong>{% endif %}
        <span class="{{ 'stamp' if tool.status == 'in development' else 'status' }}">{{ tool.status }}</span>
        {% if tool.description.en %}<p class="description">{{ tool.description.en }}</p>{% endif %}
      </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
